  _senarioDescription: You flick on the light in the basement, walk halfway down
    the stairs, and take a scan of the room. Nothing seems out of place here, same
    leaky pipes and musty air. Walking deeper down the stairs, you notice a few boot
    prints tracking from a puddle of water towards the stairs. It couldn't have been
    more than an hour ago that this had happened. One thing is for certain though.
    Someone has been here recently.
